# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Datasets -- public, large, re-downloadable (see README / scripts/).
# Covers LFW, RMFD, MFR2, synth-masked derivatives, and any archives.
data/

# Pre-trained model weights -- fetched by scripts/download_models.py
# (AIZOO caffemodel/prototxt) or auto-downloaded by insightface.
models/

# Embedding caches -- large, regenerated by re-running the experiments.
results/cache/
results/*.npy

# PERSONAL / BIOMETRIC DATA -- never commit these.
# The demo gallery stores face embeddings of enrolled users, and the
# capture/screenshot folders contain webcam photos of real people.
results/demo_gallery.*
results/demo_captures/
results/demo_screenshots/
results/_smoke_gallery.*
results/*.npz

# Keep: results/*_summary.json, results/*.csv (experiment outputs),
# report/figures/ (metric plots only -- no face imagery), REPORT.md,
# PRESENTATION.md, the .pptx deck, and all source code.
